<item>
            <title>[MAHOUT-159] SparseVector and DenseVector hashCode does not conform to the Java standard</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/MAHOUT-159</link>
                <project id="12310751" key="MAHOUT">Mahout</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;The hash codes for SparseVector and DenseVector will not be equal even though equals() may return true. Also, the equals logic is inconsistent because DenseVector takes into account the name parameter but SparseVector does not.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
                <environment></environment>
        <key id="12432179">MAHOUT-159</key>
            <summary>SparseVector and DenseVector hashCode does not conform to the Java standard</summary>
